# GR-55 device layer

- Routes SoT: `routes.ts`. Connected surface: `patchRoute` only. Legacy paths redirect.
- Shell: `AppShell.tsx` — Exit · Sync · `Gr55Workspace` (no AI anywhere).
- Workspace: `src/experience/IntentionWorkspace.tsx` plus `src/devices/gr55/intentions/`. What the musician sees: [docs/current/intention-workbench.md](../../docs/current/intention-workbench.md). No rhythm catalog.
- Advanced opens from the Guitar sheet: `AdvancedPatchEditor.tsx` on `verifiedFieldHost` (same queue).
- Connect / Exit: `connectionThunks.ts`. No port memory. SoT [docs/current/connection-resume.md](../../docs/current/connection-resume.md). Live MIDI in `connectionRuntime`, not Redux.
- On connect: identify, then `readSystem` → system `load` → `readPatch` → `readPatchLocation`. No writes during discovery.
- **Writes, save, authority**: [docs/current/intention-workbench.md](../../docs/current/intention-workbench.md) (Confirmed writes). One verified operation; the mirror updates from the readback.
- Instruments: `instrumentProfiles.ts`. Tone names: `presets/toneLibrary.ts`. Tone search: `toneMatch.ts`.
- Field keys for Advanced: `pages.ts` (`PAGE_IDS` frozen).
- Fake pedal: `fakeDevice.ts` for tests and the DEV “simulated pedal” path. Not shown when SysEx is unavailable outside development.
- Product SoT: `docs/current/intention-workbench.md`. Claims: `docs/current/capability-matrix.md`. Config taxonomy: `docs/current/gr55-config-scope.md`.
